{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1219","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1219/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1219/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1219/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vimeo/psalm/issues/1219","id":401050812,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU0MDEwNTA4MTI=","number":1219,"title":"is_subclass_of doesn't reveal properties of an already specialised class-string","user":{"login":"aidantwoods","id":3288888,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODg4ODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3288888?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods","html_url":"https://github.com/aidantwoods","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aidantwoods/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":486061586,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0ODYwNjE1ODY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ee0701","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2019-01-20T01:01:33Z","updated_at":"2019-01-20T15:39:13Z","closed_at":"2019-01-20T15:39:13Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"https://getpsalm.org/r/2aa4c9ac7b\r\n\r\n```php\r\n<?php\r\ninterface Foo {\r\n  public static function Bar() : bool;\r\n};\r\n\r\ninterface Bar {}\r\n\r\nclass FooClass implements Foo, Bar {\r\n  public static function Bar() : bool {\r\n    return true;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n/**\r\n * @param class-string<Bar> $className\r\n */\r\nfunction foo($className) : bool {\r\n  if (is_subclass_of($className, Foo::class, true)) {\r\n    return $className::Bar();\r\n  }\r\n  \r\n  return false;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nPsalm output (using commit 590bea3): \r\n```\r\nINFO: MixedMethodCall - 20:12 - Cannot call constructor on an unknown class\r\n\r\nINFO: MixedReturnStatement - 20:5 - Could not infer a return type\r\n\r\nINFO: MixedInferredReturnType - 18:28 - Could not verify return type 'bool' for foo\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI suspect this might be because Psalm can't currently represent non-object intersection types?\r\n\r\ne.g. `@param class-string<Bar>&class-string<Foo> $className` gives:  `ERROR: InvalidDocblock [...] Intersection types must all be objects, [...]`, and the slightly preferable `@param class-string<Bar&Foo> $className` gives:  `ERROR: UndefinedClass [...] Class or interface Bar&Foo does not exist`\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"muglug","id":2292638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2292638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug","html_url":"https://github.com/muglug","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1219/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1219/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}